## TL;DR – Minimal code snippet (if you already have the icons loaded)

If you **already added the icons** elsewhere and just need the layer:

```js
map.addSource('venues', {
  type: 'geojson',
  data: 'https://your-domain.com/data/venues.geojson'
});

map.addLayer({
  id: 'venue-icons',
  type: 'symbol',
  source: 'venues',
  layout: {
    'icon-image': ['get', 'category'],
    'icon-size': ['interpolate', ['linear'], ['zoom'], 10, 0.5, 15, 1],
    'icon-allow-overlap': false,
    'icon-optional': true
  }
});
```

That’s all you need once the icons are registered.

